<title>UK: Troll field set to load 6.7 mln bls in Feb.</title>
<headline>Troll field set to load 6.7 mln bls in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The North Sea Troll oilfield is scheduled to load 6.7 million barrels of crude in February, slightly down on the 7.1 million barrels January programme, traders said.  </p>
<p>The slightly lower programme accounts for the shorter month, they said.</p>
<p>They said the February programme comprised five 400,000 barrel cargoes, four at 500,000 barrels, one at 800,000 barrels, one at 700,000 barrels and two at 600,000.</p>
<p>The February programme comprised 13 cargoes in total, the same as the two previous months.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
